[
  {"comment": "Sketches on cylindrical and conical faces (mitcad#1768) on OCCT. A rod: a circle of diameter 20 (Sketch1 F1, d1) extruded 30 up the Z axis (F2): 100 pi 30."},
  {"cmd": "sketch.create"},
  {"cmd": "sketch.add_circle", "sketch": "F1", "center": [0, 0], "diameter": 20},
  {"cmd": "add_feature", "def": {"type": "extrude", "profiles": [{"sketch": "F1", "region": "r{c1}"}],
    "extent": {"type": "distance", "distance": 30}, "operation": "new_body"}},
  {"expect": {"body": "F2.b0", "volume": 9424.77796076938, "faces": 3}},

  {"comment": "Sketch2 (F3) on the rod's side in its developed coordinates, its origin at z = 0 on the +Y side: a dimensioned 6 x 4 rectangle from z = 10 to 14 (c1..c4, points p5..p8), 'Mitcad' in the bundled font, height 10, from z = 20 (t9; its regions 70.95644374688502 mm^2 as in emboss.json), and a line once around the rod at z = 5 (c10)."},
  {"cmd": "sketch.create", "plane": {"face": "F2:side(c1)", "body": "F2.b0", "developed": {"angle": 1.5707963267948966}}},
  {"cmd": "sketch.add_rectangle", "sketch": "F3", "corner": [-3, 10], "width": 6, "height": 4},
  {"cmd": "sketch.add_text", "sketch": "F3", "text": "Mitcad", "at": [-15, 20], "height": 10},
  {"cmd": "sketch.add_line", "sketch": "F3", "start": [-31.41592653589793, 5], "end": [31.41592653589793, 5]},
  {"expect": {"feature": "Sketch2", "status": "ok"}},
  {"expect": {"query": {"query": "sketch", "uid": "F3"},
    "result": {"surface": {"kind": "cylinder", "radius": 10, "axis": {"origin": [0, 0, 0], "direction": [0, 0, 1]}},
               "frame": {"origin": [0, 10, 0], "normal": [0, 1, 0]}}}},
  {"comment": "The curves' lengths on the face: the rectangle's bottom 6 and side 4, the line around the rod its circumference."},
  {"expect": {"query": {"query": "sketch_surface", "sketch": "F3", "curves": true, "only": ["c1", "c2", "c10"]},
    "result": {"curves": [{"id": "c1", "length": 6}, {"id": "c2", "length": 4},
                          {"id": "c10", "length": 62.83185307179586}]}}},
  {"comment": "A sketch point on the face and a ray from the front onto it."},
  {"expect": {"query": {"query": "sketch_surface", "sketch": "F3", "points": [[0, 12]],
                        "rays": [{"origin": [0, 50, 12], "direction": [0, -1, 0]}]},
    "result": {"points": [{"at": [0, 10, 12], "normal": [0, 1, 0]}],
               "rays": [{"hit": true, "point": [0, 12], "distance": 40}]}}},

  {"comment": "The rectangle raised 1 out of the rod (Extrude2, F4): wrapped, 24 * 21 / 20 more; four walls and a top."},
  {"cmd": "add_feature", "def": {"type": "extrude",
    "profiles": [{"sketch": "F3", "region": "r{c1[c4,c2],c2[c1,c3],c3[c2,c4],c4[c3,c1]}"}],
    "extent": {"type": "distance", "distance": 1}, "operation": "join"}},
  {"expect": {"feature": "Extrude2", "status": "ok", "body": "F2.b0", "volume": 9449.97796076938, "faces": 8,
    "has_face": "F4:end(r{c1[c4,c2],c2[c1,c3],c3[c2,c4],c4[c3,c1]})"}},

  {"comment": "The rod made 30 across (d1): the sketch follows its side, the rectangle 24 * 31 / 30; and back."},
  {"cmd": "set_parameter", "name": "d1", "value": 30},
  {"expect": {"feature": "Extrude2", "status": "ok", "body": "F2.b0", "volume": 21230.550411731103}},
  {"expect": {"query": {"query": "sketch", "uid": "F3"}, "result": {"surface": {"radius": 15}, "frame": {"origin": [0, 15, 0]}}}},
  {"cmd": "set_parameter", "name": "d1", "value": 20},
  {"expect": {"body": "F2.b0", "volume": 9449.97796076938}},

  {"comment": "The side split by the line around the rod (SplitFace1, F5): one face more, the same volume. (Before the text: the counters of its letters stay pieces of the side, which the line does not cross, and Split Face splits every piece of the faces it names.)"},
  {"cmd": "add_feature", "def": {"type": "split_face", "body": "F2.b0", "faces": ["F2:side(c1)"],
    "tool": {"sketch": "F3", "curves": ["c10"]}}},
  {"expect": {"feature": "SplitFace1", "status": "ok", "body": "F2.b0", "volume": 9449.97796076938, "faces": 9,
    "has_face": "F2:side(c1)#1"}},

  {"comment": "The text sunk 1 into the rod (Emboss1, F6, no face of its own): A * 19 / 20 less."},
  {"cmd": "add_feature", "def": {"type": "emboss", "profiles": [
    {"sketch": "F3", "region": "r{t9.g0.c0}"}, {"sketch": "F3", "region": "r{t9.g1.c0}"},
    {"sketch": "F3", "region": "r{t9.g1.c1}"}, {"sketch": "F3", "region": "r{t9.g2.c0}"},
    {"sketch": "F3", "region": "r{t9.g3.c0}"}, {"sketch": "F3", "region": "r{t9.g4.c0}"},
    {"sketch": "F3", "region": "r{t9.g5.c0}"}], "depth": 1, "mode": "sink"}},
  {"expect": {"feature": "Emboss1", "status": "ok", "body": "F2.b0", "volume": 9382.569339209838,
    "has_face": "F6:end(r{t9.g0.c0})"}},

  {"comment": "A cone: Sketch3 (F7) on XY, the triangle (0, 0), (20, 0), (0, 30) revolved about Y (Revolve1, F8): 20^2 pi 30 / 3; its apex at (0, 30, 0), its half angle atan(20 / 30)."},
  {"cmd": "sketch.create"},
  {"cmd": "sketch.add_line", "sketch": "F7", "start": [0, 0], "end": [20, 0]},
  {"cmd": "sketch.add_line", "sketch": "F7", "start": [20, 0], "end": [0, 30]},
  {"cmd": "sketch.add_line", "sketch": "F7", "start": [0, 30], "end": [0, 0]},
  {"cmd": "add_feature", "def": {"type": "revolve",
    "profiles": [{"sketch": "F7", "region": "r{c1[c7,c4],c4[c1,c7],c7[c4,c1]}"}],
    "axis": "y", "extent": {"type": "full"}, "operation": "new_body"}},
  {"expect": {"feature": "Revolve1", "status": "ok", "body": "F8.b0", "volume": 12566.370614359172,
    "tolerance": 1e-6, "faces": 2}},

  {"comment": "Sketch4 (F9) on the cone's side, its development: the origin on the base circle at +X, y up the cone towards the apex. A 6 x 4 rectangle from y = 8 to 12 raised 0.5 along the cone's normals (Extrude3, F10): the integral of 0.5 + 0.125 cos(a) / (rho sin(a)) over the rectangle, rho its distance from the apex's image, 12.172664765174336 more."},
  {"cmd": "sketch.create", "plane": {"face": "F8:side(c4[c1,c7])", "body": "F8.b0", "developed": {}}},
  {"cmd": "sketch.add_rectangle", "sketch": "F9", "corner": [-3, 8], "width": 6, "height": 4},
  {"expect": {"query": {"query": "sketch", "uid": "F9"},
    "result": {"surface": {"kind": "cone", "radius": 20, "apex": [0, 30, 0]}, "frame": {"origin": [20, 0, 0], "normal": [1, 0, 0]}}}},
  {"expect": {"query": {"query": "sketch_surface", "sketch": "F9", "curves": true, "only": ["c1", "c2"]},
    "result": {"curves": [{"id": "c1", "length": 6}, {"id": "c2", "length": 4}]}}},
  {"cmd": "add_feature", "def": {"type": "extrude",
    "profiles": [{"sketch": "F9", "region": "r{c1[c4,c2],c2[c1,c3],c3[c2,c4],c4[c3,c1]}"}],
    "extent": {"type": "distance", "distance": 0.5}, "operation": "join", "participants": ["F8.b0"]}},
  {"expect": {"feature": "Extrude3", "status": "ok", "body": "F8.b0", "volume": 12578.543279124346,
    "tolerance": 1e-5, "faces": 7}},

  {"comment": "Sketch5 (F11) on the cone's side: a 4 x 4 square from x = 6 to 10 and y = 16 to 20, and one from x = -2 to 2 across the seam the revolve left at x = 0 (mitcad#1853), split the cone's face (SplitFace2, F12): one face more for each square, each square's 16 mm^2 (a development keeps areas), the same volume. The square across the seam is one face, not the two halves on either side of the seam that OCCT's split leaves."},
  {"cmd": "sketch.create", "plane": {"face": "F8:side(c4[c1,c7])", "body": "F8.b0", "developed": {}}},
  {"cmd": "sketch.add_rectangle", "sketch": "F11", "corner": [6, 16], "width": 4, "height": 4},
  {"cmd": "sketch.add_rectangle", "sketch": "F11", "corner": [-2, 16], "width": 4, "height": 4},
  {"cmd": "add_feature", "def": {"type": "split_face", "body": "F8.b0", "faces": ["F8:side(c4[c1,c7])"],
    "tool": {"sketch": "F11"}}},
  {"expect": {"feature": "SplitFace2", "status": "ok", "body": "F8.b0", "volume": 12578.543279124346,
    "tolerance": 1e-5, "faces": 9}},
  {"comment": "The two squares are the faces of 10 to 20 mm^2 (the raised rectangle's walls are smaller, its top larger)."},
  {"expect": {"query": {"query": "faces", "body": "F8.b0", "geometry": true, "min_area": 10, "max_area": 20},
    "result": {"total": 2, "faces": [{"area": 16}, {"area": 16}]},
    "tolerance": 1e-5}},
  {"expect": {"body": "F2.b0", "volume": 9382.569339209838}}
]
